0x150.webp)](https://www.guptasen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Aurum-Girnar-Teen-Batti-Malabar-Hill-4-BHK-Premium-Bathroom-Interior.webp)\n- [![Aurum Girnar Teen Batti Malabar Hill 3 BHK Bathroom With Double Vanity](https://www.guptasen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Aurum-Girnar-Teen-Batti-Malabar-Hill-3-BHK-Double-Vanity-Bathroom-150x150.webp)](https://www.guptasen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Aurum-Girnar-Teen-Batti-Malabar-Hill-3-BHK-Double-Vanity-Bathroom.webp)\n- [![Aurum Girnar Teen Batti Malabar Hill 4 BHK Tower With Sea Facing Location](https://www.guptasen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Aurum-Girnar-Teen-Batti-Malabar-Hill-4-BHK-Sea-Facing-Tower-View-150x150.webp)](https://www.guptasen.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Aurum-Girnar-Teen-Batti-Malabar-Hill-4-BHK-Sea-Facing-Tower-View.webp)\n\n## Property overview\n\nPrice\n:   ₹ 29.49 Cr\n\nContract\n:   New Constructions\n\nLocation\n:   Malabar Hill\n\nArea\n:   2,300 sqft\n\nBaths\n:   3\n\nBeds\n:   3\n\nParking\n:   3\n\n## Description\n\n## **Aurum Girnar – 2 BHK 3 BHK 4 BHK Flats In Malabar Hill**\n\nThere are many prestigious addresses in Mumbai. There is only one [Malabar Hill](https://www.guptasen.com/location/malabar-hill/). And upon this singular address — the most coveted, historically resonant, and permanently irreplaceable residential precinct in all of India — [Aurum Real Estate](https://aurumrealestate.in/) presents **Aurum Girnar**: a monument to ultra-luxury living that offers just **6 Sky Residences** to the world’s most discerning buyers. Part of the elite [Aurum Privé](https://www.aurumprive.in/) portfolio — the private collection of residences reserved for those for whom excellence is not a preference but an expectation — **Aurum Girnar** at **Malabar Hill, Mumbai – 400006** is not an address. It is a dynasty’s foundation. A generational estate. The final opportunity to claim sovereignty over Mumbai’s most enduring hill.\n\nAurum Privé Portfolio\n\n## Aurum Girnar\n\n📍 Malabar Hill, Mumbai 400006 — Ultra-Luxury Sky Residences\n\nRare Collection\n\n• Only 6 Residences\n\n• Possession: June 2029\n\nThe Outlook\n\n180° Panoramic\n\nUninterrupted, breathtaking views of the Arabian Sea.\n\nThe Layout\n\nOne Per Floor\n\nPrivate elevators and absolute discretion for the elite few.\n\nThe Arrival\n\nA grand entrance lobby paired with 7 levels of dedicated parking.\n\nSimplex Sky Residences  \n MahaRERA: P51900080926\n\n| Configuration | RERA Carpet Area | Starting Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Simplex Sky Residence (19th Floor+) | 2,300 Sq.Ft. | ₹29.49 Crores\\* |\n\n**Curated Amenities**  \n • Oasis 34 — Meditation & Terrace Retreat  \n • Horizon Club — Refined Leisure Space  \n • Executive Suites & Elegant Banquet  \n • 3 Reserved Car Parks per residence\n\n**The Power Corridor**  \n • CM Residence & Governor House (1.9km)  \n • Priyadarshini Park (1.3km)  \n • Malabar Hill Club (1.6km)  \n • Jain Temple & Banganga (Within 2km)\n\n“This is not an address. This is your dynasty’s foundation.”\n\nAurum Real Estate Portfolio\n\n[Aurum Seven (Walkeshwar)](https://www.guptasen.com/properties/aurum-seven-walkeshwar-duplex-triplex/) | [Aurum Arts (Worli)](https://www.guptasen.com/properties/aurum-arts-worli/) | [Aurum Q Parć](https://aurumrealestate.in/ongoing/commercial/aurum-q-parc) | [7 Marine Drive](https://www.studocu.com/in/document/st-xaviers-college-mumbai/master-in-management-studies/35303-aurum-7-marine-drive-automated-brochure/73739017)\n\n---\n\n### **Project Overview**\n\n**Aurum Girnar** is a landmark ultra-luxury residential tower rising across **Floors 17 to 33** — with just **6 Sky Residences** occupying this rarefied vertical range, delivering a density of exclusivity that no other new residential development in **Mumbai** can claim. The building is accessed through a **double-height grand entrance lobby** that sets the tone for every arrival with architectural authority and quiet opulence. **Floors 1 through 7** are dedicated entirely to parking infrastructure — delivering **3 reserved car parks per residence**, a ratio of provision that reflects the scale of life this building is designed to accommodate. **Private elevators** serve each residence with the discretion and directness that India’s most accomplished families demand. The project is registered under **MahaRERA No. P51900080926**, with possession committed for **June 2029**, and is available for private consultation through the **Aurum Privé family office advisory team**.\n\n---\n\n### **Sky Residence Configuration**\n\n**Aurum Girnar** offers **2 BHK 3 BHK 4 BHK** and a uncompromising configuration — a **Simplex Sky Residence** of **2,300 sq. ft. RERA carpet area** — designed for those who regard space not as a metric but as a statement of who they are. With **180° panoramic views of the Arabian Sea** framing every principal room, the residence delivers a visual experience that is as permanent and irreplaceable as the address itself. Priced from **₹29.49 Crores + taxes** from the **19th floor onwards**, each residence commands a presence on **Malabar Hill’s** skyline that has never before been available in new construction. The interiors are conceived to the highest specification — delivering the refined elegance, material excellence, and spatial generosity that the **Aurum Privé** name demands of every development it carries.\n\n---\n\n### **Pricing & Investment Potential**\n\nAt **₹29.49 Crores and above**, **Aurum Girnar** occupies the absolute apex of Mumbai’s ultra-premium residential market — a segment defined not by price sensitivity but by the absolute scarcity of the product being offered. **Malabar Hill** is Mumbai’s most permanently valuable residential land — home to the **Governor of Maharashtra’s residence, the Chief Minister’s official bungalow**, and generations of India’s most distinguished families. Land availability on the hill is functionally exhausted, making **Aurum Girnar** a genuinely irreplaceable acquisition. For **UHNI and NRI buyers** who understand that great addresses appreciate because they cannot be replicated, this is Mumbai’s most structurally compelling ultra-luxury investment of the decade. With only **6 residences** available globally, the scarcity premium built into this asset is permanent and structurally unassailable.\n\n---\n\n### **Amenities & Lifestyle Features**\n\nThe lifestyle offering at **Aurum Girnar** is curated with the restraint and precision that befits a building of this calibre. **Oasis 34** — a tranquil sky terrace and meditation retreat at elevation — offers residents a private sanctuary above the city, framing the **Arabian Sea** horizon as a living artwork. The **Horizon Club** provides a refined leisure space for private gatherings, quiet reflection, and the measured enjoyment of a life well-built. **Executive suites** and **elegant celebration banquets** complete an amenity palette that serves the full spectrum of private and social life — always with the understated excellence that separates a **Malabar Hill** address from every other in the city.\n\n---\n\n### **Prime Location Advantages – Malabar Hill, Mumbai 400006**\n\n**Malabar Hill** is Mumbai’s power corridor, spiritual sanctuary, and natural retreat — simultaneously. The **Jain Temple** is **0.7 km** away. [Priyadarshini Park](https://www.priyadarshinipark.org/) and the **Malabar Hill Nature Trail** are within **1.3–1.6 km**. The [Lok Bhavan](https://rajbhavan-maharashtra.gov.in/en/)**, Chief Minister’s Residence,** [Malabar Hill Club](https://malabarhillclub.com/), and **Governor House** are all within **1.5–1.9 km**. The sacred **Banganga Tank** is **1.9 km** away, and [Babulnath Temple](https://www.babulnath.com/) is **2.7 km** from the building. **Marine Drive, Nariman Point**, and **South Mumbai’s** entire cultural, financial, and social infrastructure surround this address on every side — making **Malabar Hill** the only location in Mumbai where nature, power, spirituality, and urban eminence exist in genuine harmony.\n\n---\n\n### **About The Developer – Aurum Real Estate**\n\n**Aurum Real Estate** operates on a singular thesis: **Zero Delay. Zero Compromise.** From the benchmark-setting **7 Marine Drive** to the **LEED Platinum-certified Aurum Q Parć** — India’s premier integrated township — to **Aurum Seven** at Walkeshwar and **Aurum Arts** at Worli, the firm has established itself as the trusted steward of Mumbai’s most significant residential and commercial assets. Every **Aurum** project is a statement of uncompromising quality and absolute financial prudence — values most completely expressed in **Aurum Girnar**.\n\n---\n\n### **Why Choose Aurum Girnar**\n\n**Aurum Girnar** is Mumbai’s most singular residential offering — just **6 Sky Residences** of **2,300 sq. ft.** on **Malabar Hill**, **3 car parks per home**, **180° Arabian Sea views**, curated sky amenities, and the **Zero Delay. Zero Compromise.** standard of **Aurum Real Estate** — all under **MahaRERA No. P51900080926**. For those who understand that **Malabar Hill** cannot be built again, this is the last great address Mumbai will ever create.\n\n---\n\n### Location Map\n\n---\n\n## Contact Us\n\nTo express your interest in owning this exclusive residence, please call us directly.\n\n📞 [+91 98206 07875](tel:+919820607875)\n\nOr simply fill in the short form below and our property specialist will contact you shortly.\n\n## Amenities\n\n* Air Conditioned Lobby\n* Alfresco Dining\n* Badminton Court\n* Balcony\n* Banquet Hall\n* Basketball Court\n* Billiards Room\n* Business Centre\n* Cafe\n* CCTV Surveillance\n* Central AC\n* Children's Play Area\n* Cleaning after exit\n* Clubhouse\n* Concierge\n* Cricket Pitch\n* Cycling Track\n* Deck\n* Driver Waiting Area\n* E.V. Charging Station\n* Football court\n* Futsal Court\n* Garden\n* Gym\n* Hammam\n* Heated Pool\n* Indoor games\n* Indoor Swimming Pool\n* Jogging Track\n* Kids Pool\n* Library\n* Maintenance Staff\n* Mini The